    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Chair of Paediatrics & Child Health, Associate Professor Dr Fyezah Jehan, represented Pakistan at the prestigious Gates Foundation annual Goalkeepers 2030 event in New York on September 20 for her efforts to enhance the survival of premature babies. She was selected as one of the global 'Goalkeepers' by the Gates Foundation.",
